      "updated": 1784640508136,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Section comes under fire and using individual f&M forms a baseline. \nSection commander formulates his plan, \nwhile 2IC and remainder of the section wins the firefight. ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Section comes under fire and using individual f&M forms a baseline. \nSection commander formulates his plan, \nwhile 2IC and remainder of the section wins the firefight. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
